@title STORY • MAYA: RECEIPTS
@bg dorm_room_night
You're Maya Shah. Midfielder. Chicago. Your Notes app has 412 entries. Your camera roll has 9,000 screenshots. Your best friend Chloe isn't speaking to you.
Your little sister, on FaceTime: Why do you screenshot everything?
> [Sweet] "...So I don't miss anything." -> a1
> [Bitchy] "Because people lie, Anika." -> a2
*a1
@add Honest 2
Anika: You never miss anything. You're the one who always knows.
Maya: Yeah. But nobody ever tells me stuff. I have to find it.
@jump a_done
*a2
Anika: (very seriously, age eleven) You lie too, Maya. You lie when you say you're fine.
Out of the mouths of babes.
*a_done
@bg soccer_pitch_night
@show chloe
Chloe makes a ridiculous save in the 89th minute. The whole team mobs her. You hang back.
> [Bold] Run in and hug her anyway. -> b1
> [Good] Delete the screenshots of her story. All of them. In front of her. -> b2
*b1
@add Chloe_Bond 2
She stiffens. Then, slowly, she hugs you back. Just for a second. It's enough.
@jump end
*b2
@add Chloe_Bond 3
Chloe watches you hit "Delete." Then "Recently Deleted." Then "Delete All."
Chloe: (quietly) ...That's kind of the most romantic thing you've ever done.
Maya: It's not romantic. It's an apology.
Chloe: For you? Same thing.
*end
Maya Shah collects receipts because she's scared of being left out of the story. This year, she learns she doesn't need proof that people love her.
